t listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fatty lymph node  that is bivalved and entirely submitted as FX 1 and  1A  now resubmitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  respectively  The sentinel node is designated with a blue count of 377  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast carcinoma   is pink yellow fatty tissue measuring 8 0cm x 5 5cm x 1 2cm  There is a skin ellipse along the anterior aspect of the specimen which measures 3 5cm long x 1 5cm wide  A short stitch designates superior  and a long stitch designates lateral  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior blue  posterior black  superior green  inferior yellow  The specimen is sectioned to reveal an ill defined firm pink white mass that is distinct from the surrounding yellow fatty tissue and measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  It is 1 0cm from the anterior margin  0 5cm from the posterior margin and is  2cm from the superior  inferior  medial  and lateral margins  The specimen is submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass and closest posterior margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass and closest anterior margins with overlying skin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved tissue from medial inferior portion of specimen   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved tissue from lateral superior portion of specimen  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast posterior margin   is unoriented pink yellow fatty tissue measuring 3 0cm x 1 0cm x 0 5cm  The specimen has a yellow pink fatty cut surface without focal lesions  The specimen is submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1 1A   LEFT SENT